 <li><a href="https://funds.effectivealtruism.org/funds/ea-community" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">EA Infrastructure Fund</a></li>
 </ul>
 </div>
 </div>
 </details>

 <details class="faq-details">
 <summary>

 What difference has the community made so far?
 </summary>
 <div class="faq-details-body">
 <p>

 The community has moved billions of dollars to effective organizations, launched pioneering projects in AI safety and biosecurity, influenced public policy on animal welfare and international giving, and helped thousands of people choose high-impact careers.
 </p>
 <div class="faq-details-readmore">
 <div class="faq-details-readmore-label">

 Read more
 </div>
 <ul>
 <li><a href="https://www.effectivealtruism.org/impact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Impact page (effectivealtruism.org)</a></li>
 </ul>
 </div>
 </div>
 </details>

 <details class="faq-details">
 <summary>

 Why should I join the community?
 </summary>
 <div class="faq-details-body">
 <p>

 Doing the most good possible is hard to achieve alone. The community offers companionship, feedback, job opportunities, project funding, and an environment where your most ambitious questions are taken seriously.
 </p>
 <p>

 It is also a source of motivation: working for the common good alongside other committed people makes hard decisions more sustainable over the long term.
 </p>
 </div>
 </details>

